    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "すいじょうきを　ふきだして　じぶんの すがたを　のうむで　かくす。ひとの たちいらない　やまに　すむと　いう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il est capable de générer un nuage de vapeur pour se cacher. Il vit dans des montagnes inhabitées.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It lets out billows of steam and disappears into the dense fog. It’s said to live in mountains where humans do not tread.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "水蒸気を　噴き出して　自分の　姿を 濃霧で　隠す。人の　立ち入らない 山に　住むという。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "せなかの　アームから　たいないの すいじょうきを　ふんしゃする。 やま　ひとつ　ふきとばす　いりょく。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il évacue la vapeur qui s’accumule à l’intérieur de son corps par les bras situés sur son dos. Ce jet est assez puissant pour raser des montagnes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
